ind":"announcement","title":"Release Date","summary":"Ahoy!I'm happy to announce that It's About Pirates is releasing on November 6, 2026!If you haven't added it to your wishlist yet, you can do so here:See you at sea!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-13T18:24:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262699969","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4468540-1842846814447427","game_id":"steam-4468540","kind":"announcement","title":"Steam Deck Compatibility","summary":"Hi everyone!Until It's About Pirates is officially Steam Deck Verified, I wanted to clarify what you can expect.The game should run well on the Deck! It has full controller support for gameplay and menu navigation.At Max settings I experienced solid performance: 60 FPS most of the time, with occasional drops into the 50s. For extra headroom or longer battery life, try reducing the quality level to Medium or turning off heavy settings like water reflections.If you notice any issues, please let me","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-04T18:00:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814447427","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4468540-1842212951305478","game_id":"steam-4468540","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update #4","summary":"In this demo update I fixed some bugs, improved performance, and made balancing tweaks.ChangelogFixed jitter on enemy knockbackFixed weapon upgrades showing wrong statsFixed enemy ships sometimes not catching fire from a flamethrowerDisabled performance-heavy water reflections on low quality settingsFixed the crew loss indicator popping up when already at 0 crewGeneral performance improvementsBuffed reload stat influenceManta rays no longer spawn on day 4Reduced flamethrower damageIncreased navy","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-29T11:48:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951305478","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4468540-1840944183784469","game_id":"steam-4468540","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update #3","summary":"This patch includes further control improvements, additional tutorial steps and minor bug fixes.ChangelogImproved steering-relative ship controlsAdded a steering direction indicator to the standard controlsFixed \"Repair deals damage\" effect not triggering when player is at full health Added additional tutorial steps to explain game mechanicsEnemy balancing adjustmentsCrew lost to damage now triggers an indicatorIncreased gold received from mermaidsJoin the It's About Pirates CommunityIf you want","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-16T19:14:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183784469","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4468540-1840310314342275","game_id":"steam-4468540","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update #2","summary":"Another update addressing balance changes, bug fixes and explanations of game mechanics has been deployed.ChangelogWeapon base damage now scales with the weapon level. Previously, only damage received from items increased with the weapon level.Fixed health bar glow on low HPFixed fire barrels do not explode when a ram is equippedAdded a display showing how many officer/weapon picks have been receivedDamage numbers now scale up in size for higher damageImproved mermaid crew loss indicator visibil","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-06T15:38:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314342275","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4468540-1839676055898374","game_id":"steam-4468540","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update #1","summary":"This update includes improvements based on the feedback I've received since the demo's release last week, with a focus on easing the difficulty for new players and adding an alternative steering mode.ChangelogAdded a \"second chance\" mechanic to the first adventure. You can now continue once without losing progress after a defeat.Added an alternative steering mode that can be activated in the settingsReduced damage and HP of the first bossCaptain Brandon Bounty now starts with 2 harpoons instead ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-04T20:21:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055898374","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4468540-1839676055888464","game_id":"steam-4468540","kind":"announcement","title":"It's About Pirates - Demo available now!","summary":"It's time to set sail in the It's About Pirates demo. But first, let me say thank you to the over 5000 people who have already wishlisted the game! What awaits? The demo will take you to a pirate realm called Windward Waters. You get 10 rounds to shape your build before facing the first boss of the game. Score well, and you can make your mark on the leaderboard of best pirates.FeedbackIf you want to share some feedback, report a bug, or chat with others about the game, you're welcome to join my ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-31T15:07:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055888464","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4468540-1830797770240437","game_id":"steam-4468540","kind":"announcement","title":"It's About Pirates - Announcement","summary":"Ahoy pirate fans!After 2 years of development I finally announced my pirate roguelike.Thanks to everyone who has already wishlisted the game, it helps a ton! If you haven't wishlisted yet, you can do it here:Some questions I've received about the game so far:Will there be a demo?Yes! Probably in July.Does it work on the Steam Deck?Yes, Steam Deck support is planned!Is it singleplayer or multiplayer?Singleplayer.How much will the game cost?Not yet decided, but it will be a reasonable price compar","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-26T16:37:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830797770240437","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4468540":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:31:03Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:31:03Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4468540":"2026-10-26T12:31:03Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4468540":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:31:03Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:31:03Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:31:03Z"},"4480850":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:31:03Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:31:03Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:31:03Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4468540","app_id":4468540,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:37Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"kore